## Harness
| Item | Path |
|------|------|
| Smoke | `ooda/scripts/s29_println_guard_smoke.oo` |
| Binary | `OODAC_BIN` or `ooda/oodac/oodac` |
| Fixtures | ephemeral under `$TMPDIR/s29_println_guard_$$` (not repo root) |
| Product | `ooda/oodac/c_emit_secret.oo` (println walker) + `c_emit_secret_guard.oo` (`c_secret_emit_guard`) — do not rewrite |

## Rails
| Kind | Case |
|------|------|
| FAIL-closed | `// SECRET: tok` then `println(tok)` (bare IDENT) |
| PASS no-FP | `println("tok")` string literal when `tok` is SECRET name (no `ERR secret`) |
| FAIL-closed | `// SECRET: tok` then `eprintln(tok)` **if product** names `eprintln` |

Exit 0 only if all rails hold.

